[2026-06-20T06:05:04.356Z] [INFO] 2026-06-20T06:05:04.355761Z  INFO session_loop{thread_id=019ee381-df9c-7263-9dd8-7bd1df167b0f}:submission_dispatch{otel.name="op.dispatch.user_input" submission.id="019ee381-e11b-72a1-8c09-864881c55692" codex.op="user_input"}:turn{otel.name="session_task.turn" thread.id=019ee381-df9c-7263-9dd8-7bd1df167b0f turn.id=019ee381-e11b-72a1-8c09-864881c55692 model=gpt-5.5 codex.turn.reasoning_effort=xhigh}: codex_core::stream_events_utils: ToolCall: exec_command {"cmd":"gh pr edit 155 --repo link-foundation/meta-language --title \"[D9] LLM-assisted naming & merge selection\" --body \"$(cat <<'EOF'\nFixes #121\n\n## Summary\n- Add grammar inference advisor traits and value types for naming and merge ranking.\n- Add deterministic `ConceptNamingAdvisor`, deterministic `MdlMergeAdvisor`, and validating `FallbackAdvisor`.\n- Add optional `llm-assist` feature with provider-agnostic `LlmClient`, `LlmNamingAdvisor`, and `LlmMergeAdvisor`; no provider dependency is added to the default build.\n- Route CFG inference through advisor-aware call sites via `infer_cfg_with_advisors`, while keeping `infer_cfg` deterministic by default and recording `AdviceSource` provenance in `InferenceReport`.\n\n## Reproduction\nBefore implementation, `cargo test --test unit inference_advisor` failed because the advisor API and `llm-assist` feature did not exist.\n\n## Verification\n- `cargo fmt --check`\n- `cargo clippy --all-targets --all-features`\n- `cargo test --test unit inference_advisor`\n- `cargo test --test unit inference_advisor --all-features`\n- `cargo test --test integration inference_advisor`\n- `cargo test --test integration inference_advisor --all-features`\n- `cargo test`\n- `cargo test --all-features`\n- `rust-script scripts/check-no-src-tests.rs`\n- `rust-script scripts/check-file-size.rs`\n- `rust-script scripts/check-crate-size.rs`\n- `GITHUB_BASE_REF=issue-93-8ae76e61befe rust-script scripts/check-changelog-fragment.rs`\n- `GITHUB_EVENT_NAME=pull_request GITHUB_HEAD_REF=issue-121-5baa9ce4d62f GITHUB_BASE_REF=issue-93-8ae76e61befe rust-script scripts/check-version-modification.rs`\n\n`check-file-size` passes with warnings only for pre-existing warning-band files.\nEOF\n)\"","workdir":"/tmp/gh-issue-solver-1781933383186","yield_time_ms":30000,"max_output_tokens":12000} thread_id=019ee381-df9c-7263-9dd8-7bd1df167b0f
