[2026-06-20T06:16:04.011Z] [STDOUT] Fixes #121

## Summary
- Add grammar inference advisor traits and value types for naming and merge ranking.
- Add deterministic `ConceptNamingAdvisor`, deterministic `MdlMergeAdvisor`, and validating `FallbackAdvisor`.
- Add optional `llm-assist` feature with provider-agnostic `LlmClient`, `LlmNamingAdvisor`, and `LlmMergeAdvisor`; no provider dependency is added to the default build.
- Route CFG inference through advisor-aware call sites via `infer_cfg_with_advisors`, while keeping `infer_cfg` deterministic by default and recording `AdviceSource` provenance in `InferenceReport`.

## Reproduction
Before implementation, `cargo test --test unit inference_advisor` failed because the advisor API and `llm-assist` feature did not exist.

## Verification
- `cargo fmt --check`
- `cargo clippy --all-targets --all-features`
- `cargo test --test unit inference_advisor`
- `cargo test --test unit inference_advisor --all-features`
- `cargo test --test integration inference_advisor`
- `cargo test --test integration inference_advisor --all-features`
- `cargo test`
- `cargo test --all-features`
- `rust-script scripts/check-no-src-tests.rs`
- `rust-script scripts/check-file-size.rs`
- `rust-script scripts/check-crate-size.rs`
